WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS NOT
================================================================================

Not an official source for any accreditation framework. The framework files
are a convenience transcription of published manuals. See DISCLAIMER.md before
relying on them for a submission.

No student data, roll numbers, marks, institutional rubrics or institution
config packs appear anywhere in this repository, and none ever should. A
config pack encodes an institution's own assessment policy — it belongs to
that institution, not to this project. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
